{"id":"msg_m_ex_rapi_redhood_03","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_rapi","label":"Rapi · Nikke"},"label":"8. Commander, excuse me, I know you're busy.","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_rapi_redhood_02","next":null,"speakers":{"rapi_r":"Rapi"},"icons":{"rapi_r":"si_c016_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_1","text":"Commander, excuse me, I know you're busy.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_2","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_2","text":"What is it?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_3","text":"If it's all right with you,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_4","text":"may I use the jukebox in the Commander's Room?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_5","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_5","text":"Sure, but what makes you ask?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_6","text":"Anis and I went to a record shop today,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_7","text":"and I bought a record.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_8","text":"I want to listen to it,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_9","text":"but I couldn't think of anywhere else I can do that besides the Commander's Room.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_10","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_10","text":"You bought a record?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_11","text":"Yes.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_12","text":"I can't really explain why, but it really caught my eye.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_13","text":"I desperately wanted to listen to it,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_14","text":"so I ended up buying it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_15","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_15","text":"What kind of genre is it?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_16","text":"It's retro music.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_17","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_17","text":"Retro?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_18","text":"Yes.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_19","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_19","text":"You like retro music?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_20","text":"Honestly?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_21","text":"... No. It's not really my style.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_22","text":"But for some reason,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_23","text":"I felt drawn to it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_24","text":"So I bought it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_25","text":"Is that odd?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_26","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_26","text":"Not necessarily. Everyone has moments like that.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_27","text":"They do?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_28","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_28","text":"We all have made impulse purchases in our lives.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_29","text":"Impulse purchases...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_30","text":"I see.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_31","text":"So many other people do this, not just me.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_32","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_32","text":"Of course.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_33","text":"... Thank you, Commander.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_34","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_34","text":"I also wanted to ask, won't you be bored listening to it by yourself?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_35","text":"I don't mind, but...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_36","text":"Would you listen with me, Commander?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_37","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_37","text":"If you want me to.","jump":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_39"},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_38","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_38","text":"Of course.","jump":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_43"},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_39","text":"I do.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_40","text":"Would you please join me?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_41","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_41","text":"Sure.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_42","text":"Thank you.","jump":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_44"},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_43","text":"Thank you for saying that you'll join me.","jump":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_44"},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_44","text":"Now that you'll be there with me,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_45","text":"I'll be even happier when I get to listen to the music.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_r","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_46","text":"I'll see you later.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_47","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rapi_redhood_03_47","text":"Yeah, see you.","jump":null}],"chat":true}